00:00:13.490 --> 00:00:15.130
Jason, great to have you on today.

00:00:15.130 --> 00:00:16.130
Thanks, David.

00:00:16.130 --> 00:00:17.619
Great to be here.

00:00:17.619 --> 00:00:22.460
So let's start with in figuring out, you know,
every day we hear this number of billions

00:00:22.460 --> 00:00:23.940
of dollars is going out.

00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:26.120
Everybody's getting twelve hundred bucks.

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:28.090
Unemployment's being boosted by six hundred
dollars.

00:00:28.090 --> 00:00:31.789
The paycheck protection plan, billions and
billions and billions of dollars are going

00:00:31.789 --> 00:00:32.789
out.

00:00:32.789 --> 00:00:35.730
Let's start talking through what's been announced
and what has happened.

00:00:35.730 --> 00:00:40.690
So the twelve hundred dollars were close to
two out of the three weeks that they said

00:00:40.690 --> 00:00:43.739
it would take for that money to start going
out.

00:00:43.739 --> 00:00:48.590
Is there any system yet for people who did
not get direct deposit of their tax returns

00:00:48.590 --> 00:00:51.760
last year to say, here's how you get me my
money?

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:54.980
Are any of these infrastructures in place
