00:00:54.980 --> 00:00:55.980
So they are not.

00:00:55.980 --> 00:01:02.160
The IRS has said that they're going to create
a portal on their website where people can

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:08.130
essentially go on and say, I want my money
going to this man account or going to this

00:01:08.130 --> 00:01:09.130
